  "releaseNotes": "⭐ Last 10 features:\n- [codex] Support remaining official security schemes (#257) 2026-04-10\n- [codex] Support callbacks, webhooks, and links in HTTP artifacts (#251) 2026-04-10\n- feat(csharp): add generated sdk hooks (#268) 2026-04-09\n- feat(csharp): add request and client option support (#267) 2026-04-09\n- feat(csharp): support forward-compatible open enums (#262) 2026-04-09\n- feat(auth): support OpenAPI 3.2 OAuth metadata and device flow (#261) 2026-04-09\n- feat(core): support OpenAPI 3.2 metadata fields (#260) 2026-04-09\n- feat(csharp): support OpenAPI 3.2 sequential streaming (#259) 2026-04-09\n- feat(csharp): support OpenAPI 3.2 query parameters (#258) 2026-04-09\n- feat: preserve OpenAPI security requirement semantics (#256) 2026-04-09\n🐞 Last 10 bug fixes:\n- [codex] Support remaining official security schemes (#257) 2026-04-10\n- [codex] Support callbacks, webhooks, and links in HTTP artifacts (#251) 2026-04-10\n- fix(csharp): satisfy release nullability checks (#264) 2026-04-09\n- feat: preserve OpenAPI security requirement semantics (#256) 2026-04-09\n- [codex] add vendor extension compatibility layer (#252) 2026-04-09\n- fix: restore shared helper emission 2026-04-08\n- fix: support two-project source generation 2026-04-08\n- test: fix allof trim assertion 2026-04-06\n- fix: clone oauth2 requests without missing polyfills 2026-04-06\n- fix: sanitize generated authorization helpers 2026-04-06",
